                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                            <div class="card-body text-center p-4">
                                <div class="text-primary mb-4" style="font-size: 3rem;">
                                    <i class="bi bi-people"></i>
                                </div>
                                <h3 class="card-title mb-3">Team Collaboration</h3>
                                <p class="card-text text-muted">
                                    Invite team members and collaborate in real-time, with powerful tools for commenting, sharing files, and staying connected.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                            <div class="card-body text-center p-4">
                                <div class="text-primary mb-4" style="font-size: 3rem;">
                                    <i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i>
